foldproof device and scenario profile corpus (profiles/)

The profile files in this directory are licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0).

Full licence text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode
Human-readable summary: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Attribution: "Device profiles from the foldproof corpus
(https://github.com/La-Cappuccino/foldproof), CC BY 4.0."

Upstream data quoted in these profiles keeps its own licence, recorded per
source inside each file (`sources[].licence`):

- Playwright device descriptors, Microsoft — Apache-2.0
- Chrome DevTools emulated devices, Chromium authors — BSD-3-Clause
- MDN browser-compat-data — CC0-1.0
- AOSP sdklib device definitions (devices.xml, nexus.xml, tv.xml, automotive.xml) — Apache-2.0
- Android Developers and Chrome Developers documentation — CC-BY-4.0
- Microsoft Learn documentation — CC-BY-4.0
- W3C specifications — W3C Document Licence
- Vendor technical specifications (Apple, Google, Samsung, LG) — quoted as facts
  with URL and inspection date ("vendor-fact"); no page content is reproduced
  beyond short factual quotes.

Values marked `kind: "derived"` were computed by the corpus authors and are
covered by CC BY 4.0. Values marked `kind: "measured"` carry the tool and date
that produced them.

This licence applies to the data files only. The foldproof source code is
licensed separately under Apache-2.0 (see the repository LICENSE).
